flowchart TB
  A[User action on finance screen] --> B[Finance screen component]
  B --> C[Finance API module call]
  C --> D{Role and SoD guard}
  D -- refused 403 --> E[Refusal shown in UI]
  D -- allowed --> F{Balance, status and reason rules}
  F -- refused --> E
  F -- valid --> G[Entry state updated]
  G --> H[History event appended]
  H --> I[(localStorage ledger)]
  I --> J[Approvals queue and entry page re-render]